# システム登録 (design 11.32) on a machine that is not a PC, for tools/ui_run.py:
# the program, a process now, asks the desktop (DT_RQ_SYSINST), is told the
# machine has nothing to put the system on, says so and ends without a window.
logmark
open 01a0d8c4-54c0-7a11-8c22-4d5e6f7054c0
expectsincein 30 sysinst: not a PC
wait 500
# no window of it was left
absent sysinst: opened
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
